<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in moderate trading on Thursday.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 593.73, up 1.65.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose 3 cents.</p>
<p>Advances beat declines 269 to 252.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 17,844,650 compared with 17,907,900 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EST/2130 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1881))</p>
</text>
